{
 "events": [
  {
   "id": "N1",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 0.58,
   "end": 7.78,
   "text": "At 7:25 AM, November 6th, I was watching videos on my phone... when an unknown number texted me."
  },
  {
   "id": "U1",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 8.1,
   "end": 13.75,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     8.1,
     "At midnight, the world ends."
    ],
    [
     11.0,
     "Do exactly what I say, and you'll live."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N2",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 14.48,
   "end": 17.58,
   "text": "I thought it was a prank. Then it texted again."
  },
  {
   "id": "U2",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 18.07,
   "end": 20.12,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     18.07,
     "You're wearing the orange scarf right now."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N3",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 21.15,
   "end": 24.55,
   "text": "I was. How did it know that? I was home alone."
  },
  {
   "id": "U3",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 26.74,
   "end": 33.49,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     26.74,
     "Don't go to school today."
    ],
    [
     28.84,
     "Buy water, canned food, batteries."
    ],
    [
     32.14,
     "Go. NOW."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "H1",
   "kind": "H",
   "t": 33.815,
   "end": 35.29,
   "text": "who is this??"
  },
  {
   "id": "U4",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 35.54,
   "end": 37.99,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     35.54,
     "No time."
    ],
    [
     37.44,
     "Trust me."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N4",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 38.82,
   "end": 46.32,
   "text": "So I went. The store was almost empty. The cashier kept coughing. And his eyes... were yellow."
  },
  {
   "id": "U5",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 46.81,
   "end": 52.76,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     46.81,
     "Don't touch him."
    ],
    [
     48.21,
     "Go home."
    ],
    [
     50.01,
     "Lock your door at exactly 11:58."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N5",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 53.69,
   "end": 55.89,
   "text": "At 11:58, I locked the door."
  },
  {
   "id": "N6",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 56.71,
   "end": 60.81,
   "text": "At 11:59, every phone in the city started screaming."
  },
  {
   "id": "N7",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 61.53,
   "end": 63.23,
   "text": "Then the real screaming started."
  },
  {
   "id": "U6",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 64.22,
   "end": 70.17,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     64.22,
     "RULE 1: Don't open the door. For anyone."
    ],
    [
     68.82,
     "Not even people you know."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N8",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 71.2,
   "end": 77.0,
   "text": "On day 3, someone knocked. It was Mr. Hale, my neighbor. He was begging me to let him in."
  },
  {
   "id": "N9",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 77.62,
   "end": 80.72,
   "text": "My hand was already on the lock... when my phone buzzed."
  },
  {
   "id": "U7",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 81.21,
   "end": 81.76,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     81.21,
     "Don't."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N10",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 83.29,
   "end": 88.39,
   "text": "I didn't open it. 10 seconds later, he stopped begging. And started scratching."
  },
  {
   "id": "U8",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 89.38,
   "end": 93.63,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     89.38,
     "RULE 2: The roof. 3 AM."
    ],
    [
     93.08,
     "Come alone."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N11",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 94.46,
   "end": 100.46,
   "text": "At 3 AM, something buzzed over the city. A drone. It dropped a box, right at my feet."
  },
  {
   "id": "N12",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 101.18,
   "end": 109.28,
   "text": "Inside, a radio, a flashlight, and a map. One place was circled in red. The bridge. Day 30."
  },
  {
   "id": "N13",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 110.5,
   "end": 112.4,
   "text": "On day 12, the power died."
  },
  {
   "id": "U9",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 112.89,
   "end": 117.34,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     112.89,
     "RULE 3: They're drawn to light."
    ],
    [
     116.39,
     "Keep the curtains shut."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N14",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 118.07,
   "end": 123.27,
   "text": "Across the street, someone turned on a flashlight. 30 seconds later... it went out."
  },
  {
   "id": "N15",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 124.49,
   "end": 130.29,
   "text": "Day 18. Trucks came. Men in white suits, with a logo I had never seen before."
  },
  {
   "id": "N16",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 130.91,
   "end": 133.71,
   "text": "They weren't killing the zombies. They were collecting them."
  },
  {
   "id": "N17",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 134.43,
   "end": 137.03,
   "text": "Then one of them looked up. Right at my window."
  },
  {
   "id": "U10",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 137.32,
   "end": 139.37,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     137.32,
     "GET DOWN."
    ],
    [
     139.12,
     "NOW."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N18",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 140.8,
   "end": 143.3,
   "text": "On day 23, I finally asked."
  },
  {
   "id": "H2",
   "kind": "H",
   "t": 143.84,
   "end": 146.065,
   "text": "why are you helping me?"
  },
  {
   "id": "U11",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 146.615,
   "end": 147.765,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     146.615,
     "Because I owe you."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "H3",
   "kind": "H",
   "t": 148.315,
   "end": 149.64,
   "text": "who ARE you"
  },
  {
   "id": "U12",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 150.49,
   "end": 154.14,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     150.49,
     "You used to be scared of thunder."
    ],
    [
     153.49,
     "You still are."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N19",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 155.27,
   "end": 157.47,
   "text": "How did they know that? Nobody knew that."
  },
  {
   "id": "U13",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 158.46,
   "end": 165.61,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     158.46,
     "Tomorrow. 6 AM."
    ],
    [
     160.46,
     "Get to the bridge."
    ],
    [
     162.86,
     "Don't stop. Don't look back."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N20",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 166.34,
   "end": 167.94,
   "text": "My phone was at 1%."
  },
  {
   "id": "N21",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 169.26,
   "end": 174.36,
   "text": "Day 30. I ran. I didn't stop. And they heard every single step."
  },
  {
   "id": "N22",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 175.08,
   "end": 178.58,
   "text": "I made it to the bridge. It was empty. Nobody was there."
  },
  {
   "id": "N23",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 179.6,
   "end": 181.0,
   "text": "Then my phone buzzed."
  },
  {
   "id": "U14",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 181.98,
   "end": 182.73,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     181.98,
     "Turn around."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N24",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 184.596,
   "end": 187.196,
   "text": "Behind me... was a man in a white suit."
  },
  {
   "id": "N25",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 189.016,
   "end": 192.016,
   "text": "Who do you think the unknown number is? Follow for part 2."
  }
 ],
 "story_end": 192.556,
 "total": 195.156
}